{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "4eb82c7dc1b1fadc1426be1bd94938ba2269110578a0bd9d1e5f03fec675bc78", "ja": "お姫様たちのメモリアル", "zh": "公主们的回忆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cd3b3d39a15a434c01f0c0ff678b501485f5184856eefda9444ad7f9ea92de15", "ja": "最初の問題は引き分け。2人が出演した\n『鏡の中のシャーロット』の思い出を振り\n返る。その後の第二問は、エミリーが即答。\nだが亜美真美の策略で、得点として一気に\n100万点が入ってしまう。", "zh": "第一题平局。回顾了2人出演的\n《镜中的夏洛特》的回忆。随后第二题由\n艾米莉抢先作答。但因亚美真美的策略，\n一下子获得了100万分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1000_008tak", "source_sha256": "255b8090fbe48623b217afd0939236b9f6d1704813eeb7ee13c8627423491959", "ja": "さて……それでは早速、\n解答をお願いいたします。", "zh": "那么……接下来就请作答。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "f0d29ab0b6e612fe1418a79d55ff1fb26297bc03558951bdfd7a0da33ecb42d2", "ja": "これは、何の香りの香水でしょうか？", "zh": "这是哪种香味的香水呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "d5fb6946437f1d3934b84167bbc9f6ead46b15d0f7522f2ea3b65ff8d7e65ae3", "ja": "……すずらんの香水！　なのです！", "zh": "……是铃兰香水！呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "66e27b8151252cfcb89244a2dec68a79079bb589ec32c7f906c4e8eceacb7ccf", "ja": "……すずらんの香水！　です！", "zh": "……是铃兰香水！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1004_se", "source_sha256": "7f78a84b8557ac53d9ff6e854da209b95fb2e4dbc198975d0503c05e5a168acb", "ja": "ピンポーン！", "zh": "叮咚──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "b33efa13ceb1717588749e1e38e796d8a203328d0450c31d9bd9afa6de4fd0e0", "ja": "ふふ。息の合った、良い答えですね。\nおふたりとも、正解です。", "zh": "呵呵，真是默契十足的好答案呢。\n两位都答对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "bf4530807221c5c23562f4edb53097d03928285d76189f3d90688fcdf0207525", "ja": "簡単なのです♪\nね、エミリーちゃん。", "zh": "很简单的哦♪\n对吧，艾米莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "6eed707f7aeb04c16a267269d75a238ee18216ad84e0ff1cb0dff2cfc55c5f3b", "ja": "はい！　すずらんの香水は、私たちが出演した\n『鏡の中のシャーロット』で、大切な物だったので……", "zh": "是的！铃兰香水是我们出演的《镜中的夏洛特》时非常重要的物品……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "1f0b00aac0321a6e4baf3f1a1f99b9757ca8d0ce5abbb56b848c47386760f5f9", "ja": "ずっとひとりぼっちだったシャルロットと、\nある日、鏡の中から現れたシャーロット……。", "zh": "一直孤零零的夏洛特，和某天从镜子里出现的莎洛特……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "3a3f9628df5c97388651996459eefbfd63cff07c94cb952e4675e3654a929e93", "ja": "すずらんの花の香りは、ふたりの\n大切な思い出なのです。", "zh": "铃兰花的香气，是两人珍贵的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "1f6ca04fd24c607c3c8e667c890fc465cd1634eccaf35fac67e030731121f2ad", "ja": "お友達になったふたりは、\n花束を作るために、湖のほとりへ出かけるんです。", "zh": "成为朋友的两人，要一起去湖边制作花束。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "ffc8c420bd8a6cbbc2ff84271e967c58bdcd6adf5ee94b802a335d7e8909ae13", "ja": "その時に見た、一面のすずらんの花畑……\nこの香りで、すぐにわかりました。", "zh": "那时看到的那片铃兰花海……\n闻到这个香味，我马上就认出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "b339208e02ee1cc9ede72d7544bec03ef857ca6f8a28025f1a3584b2c9062743", "ja": "でも、これでクイズの一問目は引き分けなのです。\nこれは真剣勝負、次の問題へ進むのですよ！", "zh": "不过，这样一来，猜谜的第一题就是平局了。\n这是场认真的较量，要继续进入下一题了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "f558f77f616e284adfd58d5aa47ed1e61dbe2893d1ab0cd75ff7ec06febc0805", "ja": "では、二問目に参りましょう。\n引き続き、どらまからの出題になります。", "zh": "那么，进入第二题吧。\n接下来依然是剧目中的问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "51ce44ae12749178fe134c846f4b51d3cb8e1897f24e46fee6aed844a11a6413", "ja": "問題です。屋根裏の物置部屋で、\nシャルロットが見つけた、野ばらの柄のてぃーせっと。", "zh": "请听题。在阁楼的储藏室里，\n夏洛特找到的野蔷薇花纹茶具。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "5a2fdf5243d651b08306db880372308622653645de6facc4938112974370545a", "ja": "この時、シャーロットは、ふちの欠けたかっぷを\nどのように直したでしょうか？", "zh": "这时，夏洛特是怎样修好那个杯口有缺口的杯子的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "dd8708d1301cb8ab384ea934ee8aa3f2ea809bfbe8975e7452fd7d4c1eeef8ce", "ja": "エミリー、どうぞ。", "zh": "艾米莉，请。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "93b70a6d589d9fb00616dbabb94e8f43fe6d147b0fbfa221a9e8f19a88c39aa9", "ja": "答えは、『月の光の魔法』です！", "zh": "答案是《月光的魔法》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1019_se", "source_sha256": "7f78a84b8557ac53d9ff6e854da209b95fb2e4dbc198975d0503c05e5a168acb", "ja": "ピンポーン！", "zh": "叮咚──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "30885f10625b48d6de1a27a73e1b6a04dfbda1543d18269385702edaeb2c50e0", "ja": "むぅ、先を越されてしまったのです。\nエミリーちゃん、すごい記憶力なのです……！", "zh": "唔，居然被抢先了。\n艾米莉真是记忆力惊人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "b3f45198864015779ce4b9069015b9962112686fcf9f9f7866c854e16624d20d", "ja": "ふふっ。だって私は、シャーロットですから♪", "zh": "呵呵。因为我是夏洛特嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "6dce4c226d17300868ac11d50d25642522005dbbe351b383879cba77159b8178", "ja": "直した紅茶茶碗で、シャルロットとふたりで\nお茶会をして……とても素敵な時間でした！", "zh": "用修好的红茶茶杯，和夏洛特两个人一起举办了茶会……真是一段美好的时光！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "19cbc6bbadbf4925f2b97e4f7eea19e67c7c6b34b4a43934fa0971a53d8706df", "ja": "シャルロットも、とってもうれしかったのです。\n初めて、お友達とお茶会ができて……。", "zh": "夏洛特也特别开心。第一次能和朋友一起举办茶会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1024_008tak", "source_sha256": "aa5e997db1b5ef8ede78f834b7aaf70134f9275a747a048059bdcf620273721c", "ja": "では、正解したエミリーには得点として……\n100万点が入ります。", "zh": "那么，答对的艾米莉将获得……100万分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "a3b3443e00aa07d79a9f622739df93ddea8b067a23ae1599a4e941fbdac406ad", "ja": "はい！　ありがとうございま……え？", "zh": "好的！谢谢……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "43b96186b3dd237d368c11f07e9a8f2df4b8f88ed5be92d57543c5505b32eb47", "ja": "100万点……なのです！？", "zh": "100万分……是吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1027_008tak", "source_sha256": "7499bbb9d67960abc611b85596fada31b24ad30c999c9e1dd178533482f3efca", "ja": "ええ。あちらのかんぺに、\n「正解者に100万点」と書かれておりますので。", "zh": "是的。那边的提词板上写着：“答对者可得100万分”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "017da5e46e147cf176cb06d5c76e1fb580486434162dd41385dab1a7735c6b1a", "ja": "むむむ……このままでは、どんどん差が開いて\nしまうのです。次は絶対に正解しないと……！", "zh": "唔唔唔……这样下去的话，差距会越拉越\n大的。下一题绝对得答对才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "bdc068268118fb51e2e72f70d4223707f45c382c7176a11ed901d7d60b90976e", "ja": "そこで笑っている亜美ちゃん、真美ちゃんとは、\nあとでゆっくりお話する必要があるのです。……ね？", "zh": "在那里笑的亚美和真美，之后可得好好聊聊才行……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1030_008tak", "source_sha256": "1c3bc15c313d8560a031e232c7cda0efa79358bb37159335a805f3e401d81efd", "ja": "るーるが怪しくなってきましたが……ここで一旦、次の\nこーなーへ参りましょう。エミリー、お願いします。", "zh": "规则似乎变得有些微妙了……不过在此先进入下一个\n环节吧。艾米莉，拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1031_032emi", "source_sha256": "39bacc4d30f5785236cd6e25c468c452e6be1d7cd6ebdaaa67b1b67f149831ec", "ja": "はい！　それでは、問答勝負を休憩しまして……\nここでみなさんに、懐かしい映像をお届けいたします♪", "zh": "好的！那么，先暂时休息一下问答对决……\n接下来请大家欣赏一段令人怀念的影像♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0212_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0212_story_02_1032_032emi", "source_sha256": "a824466c88c13d73494fcb17644adb23325d8c111793f36c09405d71ab149c2e", "ja": "どうぞ、ご覧ください！", "zh": "请大家欣赏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
